  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparatory missions by the Netherlands Court of Audit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on previous successful projects of institutional capacity building and cooperation with the Supreme Audit Institutions of Tunisia, Iraq and Jordan, the Netherlands Court of Audit will explore the opportunities for developing existing partnerships and expanding their technical assistance and cooperation projects to a number of other Supreme Audit Institutions in the region.At the same time, opportunities for a regional approach and exchange of experience will be explored, for example on generic themes such as the promotion of integrity or the auditing of the United Nations (UN) sustainable development goals.The five missions will result in the submission of a proposal for a multi-year regional programme of institutional strengthening of supreme audit institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
